# What is not cold fits MaxWarmCodeValues: below the hottest blocks of that size everything is cold, however often it is expected to run. The hottest blocks are not cold however many they are
# FORM: AsRead
# OPTIONS: only-passes=EstimateHeat limit=MaxWarmCodeValues:12
# RUN: pipeline EstimateHeat
# CHECK: f1 Hot 97 100
# CHECK-NEXT: f2 Cold 83 10
# CHECK: thresholds: cold=10 hot=10
# PROGRAM-OF: estimate-heat-thresholds.ir
